{"ref":"BDB, צִיחָא","hw":"צִיחָא","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">צִיחָא</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> an overseer of Nethinim <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:21\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.21\">Ne 11:21</a>, who are called <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵי צִיחָא</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:43\" href=\"/Ezra.2.43\">Ezr 2:43</a> = <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵי צִחָא</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:45\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.45\">Ne 7:46</a>; Σηα, Σιααυ, Σιαλ, Σουλαι, etc.","next":"BDB, צִיִּים","prev":"BDB, צִיּוּן²"}